docs {
  # MTSS Sample Data > Publish and Maintain Intervention Definitions
  
  Vendor actions behind the "Publish and Maintain Intervention Definitions" certification steps (`bruno/MTSS/v5/intervention`).
  Run the Foundation first. Run each script, then the certification step it feeds.
  
  | Script | Feeds certification step |
  | --- | --- |
  | Step 1 | 01 - 1st Intervention is valid |
  | Step 2 | 02 - 2nd Intervention is valid |
  | Step 3 | 03 - 1st Intervention - endDate & maxDosage were Updated |
  | Step 4 | 04 - 2nd Intervention was Deleted |
}
